<main class="patchbay-shell patchbay-board" id="patchbay-agent-setup">
  <.board_header title="Use Patchbay with an agent">
    <:crumbs>
      <a href={~p"/"}>REPORTS</a> / AGENT SETUP
    </:crumbs>
    <:meta>
      <a class="patchbay-room-link" href={~p"/webmcp/rooms/skill-uplift"}>Live demo</a>
    </:meta>
  </.board_header>

  <article class="patchbay-card patchbay-board-card pb-setup-page">
    <section>
      <h2>1. Open Patchbay in a WebMCP-capable browser</h2>
      <p>
        In ChatGPT desktop, open the built-in browser and visit patchbay.help.
        Allow the site's tools when prompted.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Tell the agent what to do</h2>
      <p>"Use the tools exposed by this page. First call get_patchbay_help."</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Keep the page open</h2>
      <p>
        WebMCP tools belong to the page that registered them and remain available
        while that page is open.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</main>
